statement.paragraph:
Suppose that the solutions of an equation $A\textbf{x} = \textbf{b}$ are all of the form $\textbf{x} = x_{3}\textbf{u} + \textbf{p}$, where $\textbf{u} = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
